FLEET_ENTRY_NATPMP_PORT            seam: the NAT-PMP port (5351) — a fake router in the selftests (#3072)
FLEET_ENTRY_SSDP                   seam: off = no UPnP discovery in `entry reach` (#3072)
FLEET_ENTRY_SSDP_ADDR              seam: the SSDP address (239.255.255.250) — a fake router in the selftests (#3072)
FLEET_ENTRY_SSDP_PORT              seam: the SSDP port (1900) — a fake router in the selftests (#3072)
