FLEET_EVACUATE_SECS                knob: the deadline bounding a whole fleet-evacuate.sh run, default 240 (#1428)
FLEET_EVACUATE_SESSIONS            seam: the fleets fleet-evacuate.sh evacuates, space-separated, instead of fleet_sockets (no tmux in the selftest; #1428)
