FLEET_TRAIN_PLAN_CMD               seam: the runner command fleet-train-plan.sh prices the selection with (the BREAK-IT drill's fake; #3241)
FLEET_TRAIN_REUSE_GH               seam: the gh fleet-train-reuse.sh reads PR runs with (the selftest's stub; #4794)
